# Optional. Defaults to data/runtime locally, or /tmp/dock-posted on Vercel
# when Blob is not configured.
# DATA_DIR=/tmp/dock-posted

# Vercel Blob — injected when you create a Blob store on this project
# and connect it (Vercel → Storage → Blob). Needed for reports, the
# /report review queue, and pump photos to survive deploys.
# Local `npm run dev` does not need this.
#
# What the owner sets:
#   BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN  production. Queue file is
#     dock-posted/review-queue.json. Photos are private objects at
#     dock-posted/report-photos/. No mail is sent for the signup.
#   DATA_DIR               optional. Local file fallback
#     (default data/runtime, or /tmp/dock-posted on Vercel when Blob
#     is not connected).
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=

# Internal /wholesale desk. If WHOLESALE_PASSWORD is unset, /wholesale is 404.
# Placeholders only. Do not commit a real password.
# WHOLESALE_PASSWORD=
# WHOLESALE_SESSION_SECRET=

# Internal /review queue. If REVIEW_PASSWORD is unset, /review is 404.
# Not in the public nav or the sitemap. Placeholders only.
# REVIEW_PASSWORD=
# REVIEW_SESSION_SECRET=

# Public X handle for the About timeline embed. No @. Defaults to DockPosted.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_X_HANDLE=DockPosted
